{"page":190,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:21","surah":9,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"يُبَشِّرُهُمْ رَبُّهُم بِرَحْمَةٍ مِّنْهُ وَرِضْوَٰنٍ وَجَنَّـٰتٍ لَّهُمْ فِيهَا نَعِيمٌ مُّقِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and their Lord gives them the good news of His mercy and pleasure, Gardens where they will have lasting bliss","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُبَشِّرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"Their Lord gives them glad tidings","transliteration":"yubashiruhum","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّهُم","en_gloss":"Their Lord gives them glad tidings","transliteration":"rabbuhum","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِرَحْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"of Mercy","transliteration":"biraḥmatin","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْهُ","en_gloss":"from Him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَرِضْوَٰنٍۢ","en_gloss":"and Pleasure","transliteration":"wariḍ'wānin","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"and Gardens","transliteration":"wajannātin","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them ","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَعِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) bliss","transliteration":"naʿīmun","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُّقِيمٌ","en_gloss":"enduring","transliteration":"muqīmun","verse_key":"9:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:21"}]},{"verse_key":"9:22","surah":9,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عِندَهُۥٓ أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and where they will remain for ever: truly, there is a tremendous reward with God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(They will) abide","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَبَدًا ۚ","en_gloss":"forever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِندَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَجْرٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a reward","transliteration":"ajrun","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"9:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:22"}]},{"verse_key":"9:23","surah":9,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟ ءَابَآءَكُمْ وَإِخْوَٰنَكُمْ أَوْلِيَآءَ إِنِ ٱسْتَحَبُّوا۟ ٱلْكُفْرَ عَلَى ٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ ۚ وَمَن يَتَوَلَّهُم مِّنكُمْ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, do not take your fathers and brothers as allies if they prefer disbelief to faith: those of you who do so are doing wrong.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَابَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your fathers","transliteration":"ābāakum","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِخْوَٰنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your brothers","transliteration":"wa-ikh'wānakum","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(as) allies","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنِ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"ini","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱسْتَحَبُّوا۟","en_gloss":"they prefer","transliteration":"is'taḥabbū","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرَ","en_gloss":"[the] disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ra","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] belief","transliteration":"l-īmāni","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَتَوَلَّهُم","en_gloss":"takes them as allies","transliteration":"yatawallahum","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":18,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"9:23"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:23"}]},{"verse_key":"9:24","surah":9,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ إِن كَانَ ءَابَآؤُكُمْ وَأَبْنَآؤُكُمْ وَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ وَأَزْوَٰجُكُمْ وَعَشِيرَتُكُمْ وَأَمْوَٰلٌ ٱقْتَرَفْتُمُوهَا وَتِجَـٰرَةٌ تَخْشَوْنَ كَسَادَهَا وَمَسَـٰكِنُ تَرْضَوْنَهَآ أَحَبَّ إِلَيْكُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ وَجِهَادٍ فِى سَبِيلِهِۦ فَتَرَبَّصُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يَأْتِىَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘If your fathers, sons, brothers, wives, tribes, the wealth you have acquired, the trade which you fear will decline, and the dwellings you love are dearer to you than God and His Messenger and the struggle in His cause, then wait until God brings about His punishment.’ God does not guide those who break away.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"are","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَابَآؤُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your fathers","transliteration":"ābāukum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَبْنَآؤُكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your sons","transliteration":"wa-abnāukum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your brothers","transliteration":"wa-ikh'wānukum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَزْوَٰجُكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your spouses","transliteration":"wa-azwājukum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَعَشِيرَتُكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your relatives","transliteration":"waʿashīratukum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَمْوَٰلٌ","en_gloss":"and wealth","transliteration":"wa-amwālun","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱقْتَرَفْتُمُوهَا","en_gloss":"that you have acquired","transliteration":"iq'taraftumūhā","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَتِجَـٰرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"and the commerce","transliteration":"watijāratun","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَخْشَوْنَ","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"takhshawna","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَسَادَهَا","en_gloss":"a decline (in) it","transliteration":"kasādahā","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَسَـٰكِنُ","en_gloss":"and the dwellings","transliteration":"wamasākinu","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَرْضَوْنَهَآ","en_gloss":"you delight (in) it","transliteration":"tarḍawnahā","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَحَبَّ","en_gloss":"(are) more beloved","transliteration":"aḥabba","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَجِهَادٍۢ","en_gloss":"and striving","transliteration":"wajihādin","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":23,"ar":"سَبِيلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His way","transliteration":"sabīlihi","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":24,"ar":"فَتَرَبَّصُوا۟","en_gloss":"then wait","transliteration":"fatarabbaṣū","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":25,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":26,"ar":"يَأْتِىَ","en_gloss":"Allah brings","transliteration":"yatiya","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah brings","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":28,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Command","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":30,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":31,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people ","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":33,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","verse_key":"9:24"},{"pos":34,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:24"}]},{"verse_key":"9:25","surah":9,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ نَصَرَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ فِى مَوَاطِنَ كَثِيرَةٍ ۙ وَيَوْمَ حُنَيْنٍ ۙ إِذْ أَعْجَبَتْكُمْ كَثْرَتُكُمْ فَلَمْ تُغْنِ عَنكُمْ شَيْـًٔا وَضَاقَتْ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْأَرْضُ بِمَا رَحُبَتْ ثُمَّ وَلَّيْتُم مُّدْبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has helped you [believers] on many battlefields, even on the day of the Battle of Hunayn. You were well pleased with your large numbers, but they were of no use to you: the earth seemed to close in on you despite its spaciousness, and you turned tail and fled.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"9:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَصَرَكُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah helped you","transliteration":"naṣarakumu","verse_key":"9:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah helped you","transliteration":"l-lahu