24,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:25"}]},{"verse_key":"9:26","surah":9,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ سَكِينَتَهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِهِۦ وَعَلَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَأَنزَلَ جُنُودًا لَّمْ تَرَوْهَا وَعَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ جَزَآءُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then God sent His calm down to His Messenger and the believers, and He sent down invisible forces. He punished the disbelievers- this is what the disbelievers deserve-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"Allah sent down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah sent down","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سَكِينَتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His tranquility","transliteration":"sakīnatahu","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlihi","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"and on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"and sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzala","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جُنُودًۭا","en_gloss":"forces","transliteration":"junūdan","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"which you did not see","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَرَوْهَا","en_gloss":"which you did not see","transliteration":"tarawhā","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَعَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"and He punished","transliteration":"waʿadhaba","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wadhālika","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":17,"ar":"جَزَآءُ","en_gloss":"(is) the recompense","transliteration":"jazāu","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"9:26"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:26"}]}]}